OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with outbreaks of rain, some
OL,7,Fmay be heavy at times. Remaining
OL,8,Fcloudy through the rest of the night
OL,9,Fwith the risk of further rain.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,12,Foccasional mostly light rain, but the
OL,13,Fodd heavier burst. Conditions will
OL,14,Fturn drier from the north later with
OL,15,Fsome sunshine developing.
